*.bundle



# Phase 2 diagnostic/pilot mSPRT checkpoints: disposable by design,
# used once to measure something (offline plumbing verification,
# real-Ollama variance) then discarded. The one real, ongoing full-run
# checkpoint (phase2_full_run.json) is deliberately NOT covered by this
# pattern and is committed as periodic insurance against local disk
# loss: see the commit that first added it for why.
benchmarks/harness/phase2_pilot*.json
benchmarks/harness/phase2_test_*.json